  "releaseNotes": "21.0.0\n* BREAKING: the assembly is now strong-named (public key token 020cde721a508be9); recompile required\n* Line level allowances and charges (BG-27/BG-28) are rendered below the item\n* German label for BT-10 reads \"Ihr Zeichen\" outside XRechnung (\"Leitweg-ID\" only for XRechnung)\n* An application's own QuestPDF license setting is kept\n* Updated dependency on FactoorSharp.FacturX to 21.0.0",
